homologue). \code{L2c} is introduced by this function; the packaged confidence
ladder jumps from \code{L2b} to \code{L3a}.

Corroboration is a \strong{bounded half-rung} marker, never additive voting: a
candidate supported by two or more \emph{independent evidence families} gets a
trailing \code{"*"} on \code{decision_label} (same level, never promoted past it).
The families are F1 measured reference spectra (\code{inhouse} / \code{online}),
F2 prediction (\code{insilico} hits, MetFrag), and F4 relationship inference
